@api = https://localhost:7119
@delivery = https://localhost:7252

### ===== 1. Happy path through the Function =====
POST {{delivery}}/admin/settings
Content-Type: application/json

{ "scenario": "happy", "duplicateRate": 0, "swapRate": 0, "dropRate": 0, "stepDelayMs": 1500 }

###
# @name happy
POST {{api}}/redemptions
Content-Type: application/json

{ "customerId": "C-100", "lines": [ { "rewardSku": "CAP-01", "quantity": 1 } ] }

### Wait ~8 s: Completed. Logs of redemption-functions show "Webhook ... accepted"
GET {{api}}/redemptions/{{happy.response.body.$.id}}

### ===== 2. Lost webhooks: reconciliation recovers them =====
POST {{delivery}}/admin/settings
Content-Type: application/json

{ "scenario": "happy", "duplicateRate": 0, "swapRate": 0, "dropRate": 0.5, "stepDelayMs": 1500 }

### Create 3-4 of these. Some get stuck; within ~2-3 minutes all should be Completed
POST {{api}}/redemptions
Content-Type: application/json

{ "customerId": "C-100", "lines": [ { "rewardSku": "CAP-01", "quantity": 1 } ] }

### Restore
POST {{delivery}}/admin/settings
Content-Type: application/json

{ "scenario": "happy", "duplicateRate": 0, "swapRate": 0, "dropRate": 0, "stepDelayMs": 1500 }